---
manual: background.common_methods
lines: [2796, 2797]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 200, height: 200 do
  @stripe = background red, height: 50
end
----------- test code
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(100, 25).first(3), "the stripe is painted"

background("@stripe").hide
wait_frames
assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(100, 25).first(3), "hide takes it off the window"

background("@stripe").show
wait_frames
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(100, 25).first(3), "show puts it back"
